  "content": "[Intro]\n[C#m]\n[E]\n[A]\n[C#m]\n[E]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C#m]Can we\nget real\n[E]for a\n[A]moment\n[C#m]You're my\none and only\n[E]friend\n[C#m]Watch the\nsunset\n[E]from your\n[A]sundeck\n[C#m]Let your\nhand rest on\n[E]mine\nI've\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[B]lived in every town [A]\n[C#m]But\n[B]here is where I find [A]home\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#m]  [E]\n[C#m]My mind is\n[F#m]o pen [E]\n[C#m]And my body is yours\n[F#m]  [G#m]\n[C#m]\n[F#m][G#m]Show me the sign\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C#m]I was\nso sure,\n[E]I was\n[A]fourteen\n[C#m]And not\nable to\n[E]love\nBut then you\n[C#m]crept up\non me\n[E]While I was\n[A]dreaming\n[C#m]Whispered\nlove into my\n[E]ear\nI've\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[B]lived in every town [A]\n[C#m]But\n[B]here is where I find [A]home\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#m]  [E]\n[C#m]My mind is\n[F#m]o pen [E]\n[C#m]And my body is yours\n[F#m]  [G#m]\n[C#m]\n[F#m][G#m]Show me the sign\n\n[Bridge]\n[A]If you're\n[G#m]tied up\n[A]I can\n[G#m]drive up\n[A]We can\n[G#m]go back\n[G]to my\nplace\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cm]  [A#]\n[Gm]My mind is\n[Cm]o pen [A#]\n[Gm]And my body is yours\n[Cm]  [D]\n[Gm]\n[Cm][D]Show me the sign\n[Cm]  [A#]\n[Gm]My mind is\n[Cm]o pen [A#]\n[Gm]My mind is\n[Cm]o pen [D]\n[Gm]\n[Cm][D]Show me the sign\n\n[Outro]\nPlease",
